
Update Info
~~~~~~~~~~~~
This update from 1.04 to 1.05 requires a whole new AccEd.Presets
file so you have to read the chapter about the presets in the Doc file.

Old users of Quest must read the entire quest doc and fix lots'a things
but it shouldn't be to complicated and it's worth it!

I hope these two doors will help you as much as they help me!

PS! There will soon be released a converter to convert your
    BBS:Node(x)/Answers to the Quest format which Account ED supports.
    It will also probably manage to convert older Questionaries from
    quest to the new standard so it could be viewed in the Account Editor.
